WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.427 --> 00:00:05.478
Unit twenty-three. Sitting Well at the Computer!

2
00:00:06.405 --> 00:00:11.205
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:11.255 --> 00:00:14.036
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.086 --> 00:00:18.389
Today we learn about Sitting Well at the Computer. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.634 --> 00:00:23.534
Posture. Say it with me. Posture!

6
00:00:27.115 --> 00:00:30.782
Sit. Say it with me. Sit!

7
00:00:34.252 --> 00:00:37.908
Back. Say it with me. Back!

8
00:00:41.358 --> 00:00:44.887
Feet. Say it with me. Feet!

9
00:00:48.424 --> 00:00:52.124
Eyes. Say it with me. Eyes!

10
00:00:55.614 --> 00:00:59.781
Distance. Say it with me. Distance!

11
00:01:03.298 --> 00:01:06.989
Break. Say it with me. Break!

12
00:01:10.445 --> 00:01:14.223
Stretch. Say it with me. Stretch!

13
00:01:17.758 --> 00:01:28.119
When I use a computer, I sit with my back straight and my feet flat. I keep my eyes a good distance from the screen. I take a break and stretch often.

14
00:01:28.169 --> 00:01:31.726
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:32.724 --> 00:01:38.133
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:38.183 --> 00:01:39.333
Back!

17
00:01:40.114 --> 00:01:45.478
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:45.528 --> 00:01:46.678
Break!

19
00:01:47.561 --> 00:01:54.117
Did you know? Taking short breaks to stretch helps your body feel better after screen time!

20
00:01:54.167 --> 00:01:56.480
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:57.317 --> 00:02:05.345
Think and answer. How should you sit when you use a computer?

22
00:02:05.395 --> 00:02:06.545
Great answer!

23
00:02:07.608 --> 00:02:13.201
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:13.251 --> 00:02:16.529
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

